  "faq": {
    "title": "FAQ",
    "items": {
      "1": {
        "q": "Q. What is DONUT?",
        "a": "DONUT is a <strong>weather-based clothing recommendation web app</strong> that analyzes real-time weather data and suggests outfits best suited to current conditions and temperature. It helps you solve \"What should I wear today?\" with data-driven guidance."
      },
      "2": {
        "q": "Q. Is it paid? Does it cost anything?",
        "a": "All services are <strong>free</strong> to use. You can freely use weather-based styling recommendations without any payment."
      },
      "3": {
        "q": "Q. What makes it different from other services?",
        "a": "Unlike general fashion curation, DONUT prioritizes <strong>real-time weather factors such as temperature, humidity, and precipitation</strong>. It offers practical guidance to keep you comfortable outdoors while helping complete stylish looks. Through login, you can register and combine your own clothes for personalized outfit management."
      },
      "4": {
        "q": "Q. Do you provide account integration?",
        "a": "For convenience, we support <strong>major social account sign-ins (SSO) such as Kakao, Naver, and Apple</strong>. However, account integration is not currently provided."
      },
      "5": {
        "q": "Q. I forgot my password.",
        "a": "DONUT uses social login (Google, Apple, Kakao), so account and password management should be handled through each provider's support center."
      },
      "6": {
        "q": "Q. How can I delete my account?",
        "a": "You can withdraw anytime from the <strong>Account Management</strong> menu in My Page. Upon withdrawal, saved closet data and created looks are permanently deleted."
      },
      "7": {
        "q": "Q. What if I find an error (bug) while using the service?",
        "a": "We apologize for the inconvenience. Please send the issue details or a screenshot to our support email, and we will review and resolve it quickly.<br /><strong>Support email</strong>: <supportMail>support@doknot.xyz</supportMail>"
      },
      "8": {
        "q": "Q. I have an idea to suggest!",
        "a": "Your feedback greatly helps improve the service. Feel free to share ideas or feature suggestions via support email anytime.<br />You can also submit feedback through the following Google Form: <googleForm><strong>Google Form</strong></googleForm>"
      }
    }
  },
